  "description": "Manufacturer may substitute components with components of equal or greater performance level\n\nWhether you're commuting to class or trekking on narrow singletracks, experience it all with the Nishiki Men's Pagosa Sport Bike. Built with a durable aluminum frame, this bike cruises with stability. The reliable 700C wheels withstand terrain from rocky roads to smooth pavement, while the disc brakes deliver optimum stopping control.\n\nFeatures:\n\nHybrid bike capable of both path and pavement rides\n\nLightweight 6061 aluminum frame with internal cables, double water bottle mounts, tapered head tube, rear rack mounts and replaceable derailleur hanger\n\nNishiki Suspension fork with 80mm travel\n\nShimano Altus 11-32T, 3 x 8 speed drivetrain\n\nShimano EZ fire triggers provide simple up and down shifting at the press of a button\n\nLightweight double wall aluminum rims with 700 x 40mm multi-pavement tires\n\nThe reliable 700C wheels withstand terrain from rocky roads to smooth pavement, while the disc brakes deliver optimum stopping control\n\nMechanical disc brakes provide reliable stopping power\n\nBike weighs approximately 33 lbs.",
